opennyai_summary.decision:
9. Thus, this Court, in the light of the judgments rendered in Sanjay (supra) and Rakesh Alias Rekhraj (supra), allows the instant petition; accordingly, while quashing and setting aside the order passed by the Superintendent of Police, Banswara to open the history-sheet against the petitioner along with entire proceedings pursuant thereto, the respondents are directed to strike out the name of the petitioner from the history-sheet maintained at the concerned police station.
]
10. Stay petition as well as all the pending applications, if any, stand disposed of.

